00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:02.529 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ALEXANDRE LEDUC, député QS,

00:01:00.394 --> 00:01:03.763 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Hochelaga-Maisonneuve

00:01:01.595 --> 00:01:04.965 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le REM de l'Est, c'est

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:06.166 size:53% position:73% line:53%
