00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:08.261 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Mathieu Prost,

00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:08.261 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada, Montréal.

00:02:14.468 --> 00:02:23.243 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La mairesse de Montréal et

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:25.245 size:53% position:73% line:53%
