00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:38.832 size:53% position:73% line:53%
questions. Je veux de

00:06:32.992 --> 00:06:39.866 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'ouverture et je veux être

00:06:38.031 --> 00:06:40.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
